Linus,

please pull sound fixes for v3.2-rc3 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound.git for-linus

The topmost commit is 05ee7964a470d29889ac48cc8274c1b5a1904a11

Containing only fixes for HD-audio, a few regression fixes, an
improvement work for ELD, and trivial patches.


Thanks!

Takashi

===

Charles Chin (1):
      ALSA: hda - pwr_nids cleanup for IDT codecs

Jesper Juhl (1):
      ALSA: hda/realtek: remove redundant semicolon

Takashi Iwai (2):
      ALSA: hda - Update URLs in document
      ALSA: hda - Fix the connection selection of ADCs on Cirrus codecs

Wu Fengguang (3):
      ALSA: hda - fix ELD memory leak
      ALSA: hda - delayed ELD repoll
      ALSA: hda - move eld->spk_alloc fixup to hdmi_update_eld()

